@host = http://localhost:5080

### Login del corresponsal (Rosa): 200 con role agent y agentId
# @name loginRosa
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "rosa@demo.relia", "password": "demo1234" }

### Perfil de Rosa con saldos
GET {{host}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginRosa.response.body.accessToken}}

### Login del admin: 200 con role admin, sin agentId
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@relia.co", "password": "admin1234" }

### Credenciales malas: 401 invalid_credentials
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "rosa@demo.relia", "password": "otra" }

### Cuerpo inválido: 422 validation_error
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "no-es-correo" }

### Sin token: 401 problem+json
GET {{host}}/me
